# Typed letters that stand for one German letter (fuer -> für, Strasse -> Straße).
ae ä
oe ö
ue ü
ss ß

# find-accent-misspellings.py: only ß/ss pairs are misspellings. Plain and
# umlaut forms are often both real words (mochte/möchte, bluten/Blüten).
only-marks ß

# German nouns are capitalised: find-supplement.py keeps capitalised words.
capitalised-nouns
